# Accepted-risk CVE allowlist for Trivy (fs + image scans).
#
# Format: one identifier per line, optional `exp:YYYY-MM-DD` expiry.
#   CVE-2024-XXXXX exp:2026-12-31
#
# Keep this file empty unless a finding has been explicitly triaged and
# accepted, with a linked ticket in the commit message. `ignore-unfixed: true`
# in the pipeline already suppresses vulnerabilities with no available fix.
